<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $0.25-0.75 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $0.25-0.75 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.25 to 0.75 lower compared to Tuesday. Trade slow. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     56.50-57.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     56.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     53.50-55.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     51.00-53.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Steady to 2.00 lower. Top 52.00 US 1-3   300-500 lbs	47.50</p>
<p>	   500-700 lbs	51.00-52.00</p>
</text>
